classDiagram
    direction TB
    note for CriticalPrimitives "Two of these six are used today.<br/>The other four wait for the pickup expiry,<br/>the payment timeout and online payment."

    class CartReviewHandler {
        <<function handleCartReviewMessage>>
        +onConfirmWord()
    }
    class OrderCreation {
        <<module order-creation.ts>>
        +checkAvailability(tx, data) Availability
        +insertOrder(tx, data) CreatedOrder
    }
    class CriticalPrimitives {
        <<module>>
        +claimWebhookEvent() boolean
        +advanceSessionState() boolean
        +lockOrderForUpdate() Order
        +lockOrderByGatewayRef() Order
        +claimExpiredPickups() Order[]
        +claimStuckOnlinePayments() Order[]
    }
    class SavingWhatsAppSender {
        +sendText(message) void
    }
    class MetaWhatsAppSender {
        +sendText(message) void
    }
    class OrderNotifier {
        +start() void
        +stop() void
        +tick() TickResult
        -runCycle()
        -notifyOne(restaurantId, orderId)
        -sendWithRetry(message)
    }

    CartReviewHandler --> OrderCreation : 1 checkAvailability · 3 insertOrder
    CartReviewHandler --> CriticalPrimitives : 2 advanceSessionState, cart_review to order_placed
    CartReviewHandler ..> SavingWhatsAppSender : 4 order received, after COMMIT
    SavingWhatsAppSender --> MetaWhatsAppSender : wraps, then saves to outbound_messages
    OrderNotifier --> SavingWhatsAppSender : status messages
